WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
SECOND NATURE
One drop. One chance.

00:02.000 --> 00:13.600
[A mechanical pulse accelerates.]

00:13.600 --> 00:15.200
[The pulse falls into near silence.]

00:15.200 --> 00:16.000
[A droplet chimes.]

00:16.000 --> 00:20.250
[A warm chord swells.]

00:20.250 --> 00:24.000
Make every second grow.
A film by Shivam Gupta.
